{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ModernFire</strong> \u2014 a real-time tactical strategy that puts players into modern military conflicts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble your own combat group of units and support.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before battle, players create a squad of units that includes infantry squads, vehicles, and commander abilities. Infantry squads consist of up to 9 light infantry units (medics, assault troops, machine gunners, etc.). Vehicles are standalone military units (heavily armored tanks, anti-infantry vehicles, landing vehicles, etc.). Commander abilities provide off-map support (artillery strikes, ballistic missiles, aerial reconnaissance, and more).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024960/extras/e7b9cdf0ba1a4fef421f87597780007a.avif?t=1768743028\" width=512 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan. Attack. Hold.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your combat group is ready, dynamic engagements unfold. Plan attacks on key map points to push the enemy out of sectors and gain the upper hand. Strengthen sector defenses with buildings, vehicles, and infantry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024960/extras/158e573e9e332f42e2ab5bc80018ee4c.avif?t=1768743028\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The construction system allows you to fortify positions. Soldiers can build defensive structures, making it easier to hold frontline positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Need backup?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call in artillery strikes, ballistic missiles, and gather additional intelligence with aerial reconnaissance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024960/extras/719d7cb64488856d80a056d3b667bb2d.avif?t=1768743028\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024960?t=1768743028","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4024960?t=1768743028","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024960/6b57e280d82f24aec0dcf5b22b674cfebcd092ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768743028","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024960/6b57e280d82f24aec0dcf5b22b674cfebcd092ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768743028","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ModernFire</strong> \u2014 a real-time tactical strategy that puts players into modern military conflicts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble your own combat group of units and support.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before battle, players create a squad of units that includes infantry squads, vehicles, and commander abilities. Infantry squads consist of up to 9 light infantry units (medics, assault troops, machine gunners, etc.). Vehicles are standalone military units (heavily armored tanks, anti-infantry vehicles, landing vehicles, etc.). Commander abilities provide off-map support (artillery strikes, ballistic missiles, aerial reconnaissance, and more).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024960/extras/e7b9cdf0ba1a4fef421f87597780007a.avif?t=1768743028\" width=512 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan. Attack. Hold.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your combat group is ready, dynamic engagements unfold. Plan attacks on key map points to push the enemy out of sectors and gain the upper hand. Strengthen sector defenses with buildings, vehicles, and infantry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024960/extras/158e573e9e332f42e2ab5bc80018ee4c.avif?t=1768743028\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The construction system allows you to fortify positions. Soldiers can build defensive structures, making it easier to hold frontline positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Need backup?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call in artillery strikes, ballistic missiles, and gather additional intelligence with aerial reconnaissance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024960/extras/719d7cb64488856d80a056d3b667bb2d.avif?t=1768743028\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p>","developers":["FireLineGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024960/2f669cee100f420286b4f159918ae35a52c45bc3/header.jpg?t=1768743028","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"ModernFire","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 @ 2.5 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br>